# Binary files — git не робить text-based diff/merge
# Docs: methodist/courses/cctweak-minicourse/specs/video-hosting-strategy.md
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary

# Text files з нормалізацією line endings (Windows CRLF → Unix LF при commit)
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
